 "releaseNotes": "Meet v2 — your photos, reimagined.                                                                                                                                                                                            \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                \nAI-powered analysis runs directly on your device to understand what's in every photo — the people, places, moments, and themes that matter to you. No cloud upload, no privacy trade-offs.                                    \n                                                            \nOnce analyzed, your library organizes itself into Smart Collections automatically. Find your best travel shots, group photos by the people in them, or discover moments you'd forgotten — all without lifting a finger.\n\nNew in v2:\n  - Smart Collections — AI automatically groups your photos by people, places, events, and themes\n  - Powerful Search — Find any photo by describing it in plain language\n  - Timeline View — Browse your library the way it happened\n  - Duplicate Detection — Find and clean up duplicate photos instantly\n  - Quality Scores — AI highlights your best shots\n\nTry everything free for 7 days. After that, keep 1,000 analyzed photos at no cost, or upgrade to Premium for unlimited access to your full library.",
 "primaryGenreName": "Photo & Video",
